<title>INDONESIA: Indofood says Q1 earnings up.</title>
<headline>Indofood says Q1 earnings up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>				  (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			 97.37   vs    76.38</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)	  64   vs	 50</p>
<p>    Net sales			 778.21   vs   878.68</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    249.08   vs   216.08</p>
<p>    Operating profit		158.87   vs   128.68</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  117.06   vs    82.29</p>
<p>Note: PT Indofood Sukses Makmur, a member of the Salim Group, is the largest noodle producer in Indonesia. The results were unaudited. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
